      "text": "PLANAR MOSFET (1960-2011, 10 µm → 22 nm):\n  Gate\n   │\n───┴─── Gate oxide (SiO₂ → high-k HfO₂)\n───────  Channel (Si, p-type for NMOS)\n  S/D   Bulk Si"
